        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 1015V-36, 36\" Rain Drip Guard Vinyl  Blade Sweep</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis 3 foot rain drip guard door sweep has a 5/8\" projection off the door to channel water away for the door. Vinyl blade sweep help seal the doors bottom specially if there is a gap. Made from Aluminum alloy 6063 and has slotted screw holes for easy adjustments. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/48-inch-rain-drip-guard-door-sweep-ngp-1015v-48\"><b>48\" Rain Drip Guard Door Sweep</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nField sizable for doors 28\" to 36\" wide. Packaged with installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 1015V-36 Rain Guard Door Sweep\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Vinyl Blade Height: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection Off Door: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Vinyl Color: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Screws: #6 x 3/4\" Stainless Steel SMS</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1015V-cutsheet.pdf?v=1704262389\" target=\"new\"><b>NGP 1015V Cutsheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
